    "title": "Actors Mission set to present 'The Diary of Anne Frank'",
    "text": "ROCK SPRINGS -- The Actors’ Mission will open its production of “The Diary of Anne Frank” on Friday, May 22 at the Broadway Theater, bringing the Pulitzer Prize-winning historical drama to the local stage.\nThe play, written by Frances Goodrich and Albert Hackett, runs through May 30. Admission to the performance and an accompanying pre-show meal are free to the public, continuing a long-standing tradition of the local theater group, according to the group’s press release.",
